<title>UK: Jarvis says talks may lead to acquisition.</title>
<headline>Jarvis says talks may lead to acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British facilities and construction group Jarvis Plc said on Tuesday it is in talks which may lead to it making a substantial acquisition.</p>
</text>
